      "content": "yeah that makes sense. i'll check the aria-labels. it's just frustrating because it feels like as soon as we fix one of these little glitches, another one just appears in a different part of the interface. it's almost like the app is actively resisting the audit or something lol. do you have any tips for tracking these down more systematically so they don't keep popping up one by one?",
