      "content": "It's like the app is \"testing\" your patience. To track down these issues more systematically:\n\n- Create a spreadsheet to document all identified issues, including:\n  - Aria-labels, aria attributes, and relevant HTML elements.\n  - Steps to reproduce the issue.\n  - Corresponding screen reader test results.\n  - Defect fix and verification actions.\n\n- Test your app on different screen readers and devices to ensure the issue persists across environments.\n- Create a checklist for your developers to review for issues like the ones you've found, making sure they address all identified issues before implementing a fix.\n- Consider implementing test automation scripts to help identify and track these types of issues in the future.\n\nThis structured approach will help you stay on top of fixes and avoid re-doing work on previous issues.",
